#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tutorials for official Qiskit Addons — circuit cutting, sample-based quantum"
" diagonalization, operator backpropagation, and more."
msgstr ""
"Tutorial untuk Qiskit Addons rasmi — pemotongan Circuit, pengurusan petak "
"kuantum berasaskan sampel, penyebaran balik pengendali, dan banyak lagi."

