#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Addons {#qiskit-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official "
"extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and"
" techniques. Each addon focuses on a specific area and includes tutorials "
"with executable code.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) ialah pakej "
"sambungan rasmi yang menyediakan algoritma dan teknik pengkomputeran kuantum"
" yang khusus. Setiap addon memberi tumpuan kepada bidang tertentu dan "
"termasuk tutorial dengan kod yang boleh dilaksanakan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Available Addons {#available-addons}"
msgstr "Addons yang Tersedia {#available-addons}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width and depth by cutting gates and wires |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization for ground state estimation |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation to reduce circuit depth |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas for improved Hamiltonian simulation |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation with tensor networks |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption for error mitigation |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones for reducing PEC sampling overhead |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Pakej | Penerangan |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Kurangkan lebar dan kedalaman Circuit dengan memotong gate dan wayar |\n"
"| **SQD** | `qiskit-addon-sqd` | Sample-based Quantum Diagonalization untuk anggaran keadaan dasar |\n"
"| **OBP** | `qiskit-addon-obp` | Operator Back-Propagation untuk mengurangkan kedalaman Circuit |\n"
"| **MPF** | `qiskit-addon-mpf` | Multi-Product Formulas untuk simulasi Hamiltonian yang lebih baik |\n"
"| **AQC-Tensor** | `qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor` | Approximate Quantum Compilation dengan rangkaian tensor |\n"
"| **PNA** | `qiskit-addon-pna` | Propagated Noise Absorption untuk pengurangan ralat |\n"
"| **SLC** | `qiskit-addon-slc` | Shaded Lightcones untuk mengurangkan overhed pensampelan PEC |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All tutorials can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on "
"your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua tutorial boleh dilaksanakan terus dalam pelayar anda menggunakan "
"Binder, atau pada pelayan Jupyter anda sendiri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For API documentation, visit the individual addon repos on "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk dokumentasi API, lawati repo addon masing-masing di "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon).\n"
